/Write a MARIE program using indirect addressing (LoadI) 
/to load characters one-by-one into the accumulator (AC) and display them. 
/Stop the program when you get the number ZERO.
Loop,       LoadI myAdd
            skipcond 400    /如果是0，跳过下一行
            Jump print
            Halt
print,      Output
            Load myAdd
            Add One
            Store myAdd
            Jump Loop

One,        Hex 1
myAdd,      ADR myName      /地址指针
myName,     Hex 04A   /J
            Hex 06F   /o
            Hex 068   /h
            Hex 06E   /n
            Hex 04E   /N
            Hex 06F   /o
            Hex 061   /a
            Hex 068   /h
            Hex 0     /0，退出字符